WEBVTT

00:00:01.170 --> 00:00:03.440
My passionate Idol Activities,

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:06.210
Aikatsu! is about to start!

00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:25.250
<i>A day when a smile naturally floats to your face.</i>

00:00:25.970 --> 00:00:29.590
<i>Even Mizuki-chan said that it's a day when a miracle might happen.</i>

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:39.850
I love Ichigo-chan when she's straining herself too!

00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:41.010
We'll give you a hand.

00:00:43.070 --> 00:00:45.440
<i>Today is the Christmas Special Event.</i>

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:48.590
<i>Until then, we're preparing for the party!</i>

00:01:05.850 --> 00:01:07.280
Hi, signalize!

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:12.620
The answer lies on the other side of the sky

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:12.620
kotae wa motto takai sora no kanata

00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:14.510
No, that's wrong

00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:14.510
iie chigau yo

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:19.890
I can see with my eyes that it's at the end of the Earth

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:19.890
boku no me ni mo mieta chi no hate

00:01:20.270 --> 00:01:21.680
Do that signalize!

00:01:21.810 --> 00:01:26.860
Something's starting to bubble up

00:01:21.810 --> 00:01:26.860
hageshiku natta mune no atsui powaa

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:30.820
From the burning power in my raging heart

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:30.820
sou da minagiru nanika ga

00:01:31.110 --> 00:01:34.360
So I'll believe in the present

00:01:31.110 --> 00:01:34.360
dakara ima wo shinjite

00:01:34.700 --> 00:01:39.530
And start today since it's more than a faint desire

00:01:34.700 --> 00:01:39.530
hajimeyou tada no akogare ja nai

00:01:39.580 --> 00:01:40.870
Chance for me

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:46.170
Dreams can make even the harshest nightmare pleasant

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:46.170
zankoku na yume ga yume de yume ni narunda

00:01:46.170 --> 00:01:50.380
It's just another challenge on the way

00:01:46.170 --> 00:01:50.380
hora chousen matteru yo

00:01:51.090 --> 00:01:55.300
Where are we headed?

00:01:51.090 --> 00:01:55.300
kimi to mukau basho wa doko darou

00:01:55.930 --> 00:01:59.050
Into a brilliant hope

00:01:55.930 --> 00:01:59.050
mabushii kibou no naka e

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:06.310
Where do we want to go? Let's go find it right now

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:06.310
nozomu basho wa doko darou sagashi ni ikou yo shuppatsu da

00:02:06.730 --> 00:02:09.690
Where we're headed

00:02:06.730 --> 00:02:09.690
mukau basho wa mirai no

00:02:10.480 --> 00:02:13.570
is into our hopes for the future

00:02:10.480 --> 00:02:13.570
bokura no kibou no naka ni

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:20.910
Our destination is the future, the light is our signal Let's go, go!

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:20.910
nozomu basho wa mirai no kagayaki ga aizu let's go, go

00:02:30.680 --> 00:02:32.160
Okay, all done!

00:02:32.820 --> 00:02:33.590
Love!

00:02:33.740 --> 00:02:35.830
We really worked up a good sweat there.

00:02:35.830 --> 00:02:36.840
That's right.

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:40.020
If that's your goal, then shouldn't you be practicing?

00:02:40.020 --> 00:02:42.550
The Special Event is tonight, you know.

00:02:42.790 --> 00:02:44.110
That may be true, but...

00:02:44.110 --> 00:02:46.420
We've gotta put some effort into the party preparation too!

00:02:46.420 --> 00:02:48.690
Don't you remember what happened, Ran-chan?

00:02:51.140 --> 00:02:54.940
The Christmas season is upon us again this year!

00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:57.170
Because it's your first year, you may not know this,

00:02:57.170 --> 00:03:01.660
but every year at Starlight Academy we hold a party in the dorms on Christmas Eve!

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:04.340
I've read about this on the web.

00:03:04.340 --> 00:03:07.390
The students hold a party late into the night.

00:03:07.390 --> 00:03:08.540
Sounds fun!

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:11.220
Doesn't seem like we'll be able to participate, though.

00:03:11.220 --> 00:03:13.670
We've got the Special Event tonight.

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:19.380
Therefore, it's time to choose the event manager from among the first-years.

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:20.740
Any volunteers?

00:03:20.740 --> 00:03:21.530
Yes!

00:03:21.530 --> 00:03:23.250
I'll do it!

00:03:23.250 --> 00:03:24.190
What?!

00:03:26.290 --> 00:03:28.680
I wasn't expecting you to volunteer so quickly.

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:30.100
It's not <i>that</i> unexpected from her.

00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:32.140
I wanted to do it so badly!

00:03:32.140 --> 00:03:34.140
I want to make this the best Christmas ever!

00:03:34.140 --> 00:03:34.940
Right!

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:36.090
Just because you—

00:03:36.090 --> 00:03:37.960
Ran, do you not like Christmas?

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:40.100
Golden fried chicken.

00:03:40.100 --> 00:03:42.570
Fluffy cakes covered in creme!

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:44.370
Y-You're too close!

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:46.780
Anyway, why is it only about food?

00:03:47.020 --> 00:03:49.180
It only happens once every year.

00:03:49.180 --> 00:03:52.410
We get to have a party with everyone 'till late at night.

00:03:52.410 --> 00:03:54.080
It'll be super fun!

00:03:55.130 --> 00:03:58.050
Well, I don't <i>really</i> dislike it...

00:03:58.230 --> 00:03:59.310
I bet she likes it.

00:03:59.310 --> 00:04:00.600
How unexpected.

00:04:01.140 --> 00:04:05.060
But don't forget that we're going to practice more before the event, alright?

00:04:05.060 --> 00:04:05.800
Okay!

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:07.500
Think of it this way:

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:11.130
If the four of us all work together to prepare the party, our teamwork'll get better too.

00:04:11.130 --> 00:04:12.190
It's two birds with one stone!

00:04:12.190 --> 00:04:13.450
Nice aphorism!

00:04:13.450 --> 00:04:14.560
You're too carefree.

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:16.800
Alright, let's go!

00:04:18.870 --> 00:04:20.400
Well, whatever.

00:04:23.740 --> 00:04:24.810
Who was that?

00:04:25.430 --> 00:04:29.340
Now then, let's start by making our Christmas dinner!

00:04:29.340 --> 00:04:31.080
Yeah!

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:36.790
This much?!

00:04:39.550 --> 00:04:42.610
Let's split up the work and make a ton!

00:04:43.470 --> 00:04:46.090
Hey, Ichigo-chan. Could you taste this for me?

00:04:46.090 --> 00:04:47.170
Okay!

00:04:50.780 --> 00:04:52.930
Ichigo-chan! Can you help me out?

00:04:52.930 --> 00:04:54.040
Okay!

00:04:55.130 --> 00:04:56.880
Cut it about this thick...

00:04:58.100 --> 00:05:00.540
You can really tell she comes from a bento shop.

00:05:00.540 --> 00:05:01.860
She's a walking cookbook.

00:05:02.390 --> 00:05:05.210
I wonder just what it is she's making over there.

00:05:05.210 --> 00:05:06.160
Dunno...

00:05:07.310 --> 00:05:10.510
I love this Ichigo-chan too!

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:35.640
You making that? Or are you eating it?

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:37.560
Both!

00:05:43.050 --> 00:05:44.770
Finished!

00:05:46.130 --> 00:05:48.270
It looks great!

00:05:55.170 --> 00:05:56.100
What <i>is</i> this?

00:05:56.100 --> 00:05:57.020
Nori bento!

00:05:57.020 --> 00:05:58.170
For <i>Christmas</i>?

00:05:58.170 --> 00:06:00.080
It's Ichigo's favorite, after all.

00:06:00.660 --> 00:06:02.020
It tastes great!

00:06:02.020 --> 00:06:04.510
Everyone, can I leave the rest to you?

00:06:04.690 --> 00:06:05.760
Yeah!

00:06:05.990 --> 00:06:08.050
Ichigo! Can you give me a hand?

00:06:08.050 --> 00:06:09.160
Okay!

00:06:10.030 --> 00:06:12.790
It'd help if we had a big speaker too.

00:06:12.790 --> 00:06:13.760
Okay!

00:06:16.630 --> 00:06:18.990
I really want to eat turkey...

00:06:18.990 --> 00:06:20.270
Okay!

00:06:32.210 --> 00:06:35.080
Ichigo-chan, I love you!

00:06:35.190 --> 00:06:39.110
Aoi, you were with Ichigo at your last school, right?

00:06:39.110 --> 00:06:41.930
Does she get like this every Christmas?

00:06:43.340 --> 00:06:44.850
It's not just Christmas;

00:06:44.850 --> 00:06:46.070
she loves all festivals.

00:06:46.070 --> 00:06:47.090
I see how it is.

00:06:47.090 --> 00:06:50.610
And if there's someone in need, she just can't help herself.

00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:54.030
You're so cute!

00:06:54.030 --> 00:06:55.230
Hey, Ichigo.

00:06:55.230 --> 00:06:57.340
Think you can help me out too?

00:06:57.340 --> 00:06:58.390
Okay!

00:07:02.990 --> 00:07:04.580
Could you give me a minute?

00:07:04.580 --> 00:07:05.330
Sure.

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:07.850
Who's she?

00:07:07.850 --> 00:07:10.490
She's our classmate, Nakayama Yuna-chan.

00:07:10.720 --> 00:07:13.470
She loves to talk, and is always energetic!

00:07:13.470 --> 00:07:15.810
She doesn't seem that energetic to me.

00:07:15.810 --> 00:07:16.760
Hey.

00:07:17.690 --> 00:07:19.250
Want some help?

00:07:19.250 --> 00:07:20.380
Thanks.

00:07:20.380 --> 00:07:23.750
Don't worry! It's more fun to do it together.

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:26.350
It'll get me more pumped for the party too.

00:07:29.860 --> 00:07:32.370
I was a bit lost in my thoughts.

00:07:32.370 --> 00:07:34.350
I was remembering Christmas with my family.

00:07:35.670 --> 00:07:39.050
My Papa and Mama live in America.

00:07:40.070 --> 00:07:42.280
They both work in New York,

00:07:42.280 --> 00:07:44.650
and I used to live with them there.

00:07:46.250 --> 00:07:49.880
But I decided that I definitely wanted to go to Starlight Academy,

00:07:49.880 --> 00:07:52.320
so I came back to Japan by myself.

00:07:54.300 --> 00:07:58.290
We were all supposed to meet up for Christmas this year,

00:07:58.290 --> 00:08:02.160
but my parents were too busy with work and can't come.

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:09.510
I couldn't help but think of the big Christmas tree that we went to see every year.

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:11.690
The big Christmas tree?

00:08:11.690 --> 00:08:14.050
Yeah. It was beautiful.

00:08:14.850 --> 00:08:15.810
Okay!

00:08:15.810 --> 00:08:16.890
Huh?

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:19.810
Okay! Leave it to us!

00:08:33.580 --> 00:08:34.620
Ichigo.

00:08:34.620 --> 00:08:36.740
Is it really alright to promise her that?

00:08:36.740 --> 00:08:37.370
Yeah.

00:08:37.760 --> 00:08:41.760
<i>We'll prepare that Christmas tree from your memories.</i>

00:08:42.630 --> 00:08:44.440
<i>Be sure to see it with us!</i>

00:08:44.990 --> 00:08:48.930
I want everyone to have the time of their lives on Christmas.

00:08:49.810 --> 00:08:51.360
Suzukawa-san!

00:08:52.770 --> 00:08:54.630
Can you even cut down a tree?

00:08:54.820 --> 00:08:56.640
It's Christmas.

00:08:56.890 --> 00:08:58.640
And you're just idols.

00:09:01.470 --> 00:09:02.870
Thank you very much!

00:09:03.530 --> 00:09:05.370
Good, let's go!

00:09:05.370 --> 00:09:06.910
Where?

00:09:06.910 --> 00:09:09.830
Where do you plan on finding a tree?

00:09:11.090 --> 00:09:12.010
A forest?

00:09:12.010 --> 00:09:13.060
No plan...

00:09:13.060 --> 00:09:14.430
Let's try going to a forest!

00:09:14.430 --> 00:09:16.000
Sounds good!

00:09:18.350 --> 00:09:21.140
If that's your plan, then perhaps I can assist you?

00:09:21.140 --> 00:09:22.720
You're from earlier!

00:09:24.380 --> 00:09:26.860
You were filming us, right?

00:09:26.860 --> 00:09:28.490
That's exactly right.

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:32.160
You're from a television station?

00:09:32.160 --> 00:09:37.410
Yeah. We're going to broadcast your Special Event performance later.

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:41.260
That's why I was getting some footage of how you are normally.

00:09:42.350 --> 00:09:43.700
Awesome!

00:09:43.700 --> 00:09:46.310
I wish we'd been told about this earlier...

00:09:46.310 --> 00:09:48.710
You'll need a car if you want to get to a forest.

00:09:48.710 --> 00:09:49.790
Right?

00:09:52.020 --> 00:09:54.520
Thank you for letting us use your car!

00:09:55.100 --> 00:09:57.040
It's alright to be a bit more natural, you know.

00:09:57.040 --> 00:09:58.510
Oh, right.

00:09:58.510 --> 00:10:01.470
That's the Christmas tree that Yuna-chan was talking about!

00:10:02.930 --> 00:10:03.690
Huge!

00:10:03.690 --> 00:10:05.990
It'll be hard to find a tree like this.

00:10:05.990 --> 00:10:08.050
Even if we found it, how do we carry it?

00:10:09.060 --> 00:10:10.620
That place might...

00:10:10.620 --> 00:10:14.210
Mr. Driver! Please head towards Angely Mountain!

00:10:14.210 --> 00:10:16.140
Angely Mountain?

00:10:16.140 --> 00:10:21.170
That's the place you went to meet the 
designer for Angely Sugar, right?

00:10:21.170 --> 00:10:26.150
Yeah. The last time I climbed up, 
there was a Christmas tree like that...

00:10:26.150 --> 00:10:27.480
I think.

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:28.480
You <i>think</i>?

00:10:28.480 --> 00:10:32.530
Yeah. I don't think that it wasn't there, at least.

00:10:32.530 --> 00:10:33.730
No, it was there!

00:10:33.730 --> 00:10:35.430
You sure about that?

00:10:37.300 --> 00:10:38.470
Ah, snow!

00:10:38.470 --> 00:10:40.150
It's snowing!

00:10:40.810 --> 00:10:42.290
This sucks.

00:10:43.860 --> 00:10:45.620
Hello, this is Hoshimiya.

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:47.640
I have a favor to ask...

00:10:55.890 --> 00:10:59.630
The snow's turned into a blizzard!

00:10:59.860 --> 00:11:03.390
None of the trees around here really seem that Christmas-y.

00:11:03.650 --> 00:11:05.390
Did you really see it?

00:11:05.770 --> 00:11:06.770
I did!

00:11:07.340 --> 00:11:10.950
I'm pretty sure I saw it over there.

00:11:10.950 --> 00:11:13.130
There's no path over there...

00:11:19.020 --> 00:11:21.010
Those girls are extraordinary!

00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:25.170
Hang in there!

00:11:25.970 --> 00:11:27.010
Yes!

00:11:36.530 --> 00:11:37.910
It's here!

00:11:37.910 --> 00:11:39.480
It's seriously huge!

00:11:41.780 --> 00:11:42.890
Okay!

00:11:42.890 --> 00:11:44.490
Don't you think it's a <i>bit</i> too big?

00:11:44.490 --> 00:11:46.880
It's a mystery how we'll get it out of here.

00:11:48.470 --> 00:11:50.680
Now, here I go!

00:11:56.610 --> 00:11:58.190
It tingles...

00:11:58.350 --> 00:11:59.900
Ichigo-chan, love!

00:11:59.900 --> 00:12:00.820
Wanna switch?

00:12:00.820 --> 00:12:02.910
Yeah, thanks.

00:12:12.950 --> 00:12:14.920
Sounds like they've started.

00:12:23.580 --> 00:12:25.810
Now to finish it off!

00:12:25.810 --> 00:12:26.990
You can do it!

00:12:27.940 --> 00:12:30.930
Ai-katsu, Ai-katsu...

00:12:31.340 --> 00:12:32.980
Is this really Aikatsu?

00:13:01.010 --> 00:13:02.490
Yay!

00:13:03.530 --> 00:13:06.390
We got it down, but how do we move it?

00:13:16.980 --> 00:13:19.190
What... are you thinking about?

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:27.270
Ai-katsu... Ai-katsu...

00:13:30.100 --> 00:13:31.510
No way...

00:13:31.510 --> 00:13:32.870
This is ridiculous!

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:34.410
It's like a sled!

00:13:35.530 --> 00:13:36.920
Here we go!

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:50.280
Goal!

00:13:50.280 --> 00:13:51.810
As if!

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:54.410
How are we going to get it to school?

00:13:58.830 --> 00:14:01.150
Ichigo-chan, I've come to help out!

00:14:01.330 --> 00:14:02.670
Mr. Gardener!

00:14:07.350 --> 00:14:09.630
Thank you so much.

00:14:09.630 --> 00:14:13.200
Not a problem. You're doing this for your friend, aren't you?

00:14:13.200 --> 00:14:15.960
And don't forget, today's Christmas Eve.

00:14:18.190 --> 00:14:20.130
Wh-What the...

00:14:20.900 --> 00:14:22.180
This is...

00:14:22.180 --> 00:14:24.130
Great!

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:26.840
See you! Merry Christmas!

00:14:27.120 --> 00:14:28.880
Thank you very much!

00:14:32.250 --> 00:14:34.890
Nice! That was a great shot, everyone!

00:14:35.030 --> 00:14:37.350
A great shot... really?

00:14:37.470 --> 00:14:40.830
We'll be airing soon, so be sure to watch it!

00:14:40.830 --> 00:14:41.790
Okay!

00:14:42.870 --> 00:14:44.360
What <i>is</i> that thing?!

00:14:44.520 --> 00:14:46.250
A Christmas tree!

00:14:46.250 --> 00:14:48.640
All we need to do now is decorate it!

00:14:48.640 --> 00:14:51.440
We're gonna be late for the Special Event at this rate!

00:14:52.010 --> 00:14:53.180
But the tree!

00:14:53.180 --> 00:14:54.370
What do we do?

00:14:57.060 --> 00:14:58.040
Huh, me?

00:14:58.500 --> 00:15:00.330
Ichigo-chan.

00:15:00.330 --> 00:15:02.040
We'll do it.

00:15:03.410 --> 00:15:04.590
Where's Yuna-chan?

00:15:04.590 --> 00:15:06.180
I think she's in her room.

00:15:06.180 --> 00:15:08.050
She looked pretty down for some reason.

00:15:09.970 --> 00:15:13.260
You girls can go and put on a great Special Event!

00:15:14.190 --> 00:15:15.080
Thanks.

00:15:19.140 --> 00:15:20.300
Shall we get to it?

00:15:20.300 --> 00:15:21.230
Sure.

00:15:22.260 --> 00:15:24.470
In the end, we didn't practice at all today.

00:15:24.470 --> 00:15:25.230
But you know—

00:15:25.230 --> 00:15:29.050
We all worked so hard together, so we'll be fine!

00:15:29.050 --> 00:15:31.090
Let's do our best on stage too!

00:15:31.090 --> 00:15:32.210
Of course!

00:15:33.180 --> 00:15:38.830
Leading up to Starlight Academy's Special Event, the idols prepared a Christmas tree.

00:15:39.190 --> 00:15:42.430
Here's the whole story of what transpired before the event.

00:15:42.430 --> 00:15:43.480
Everyone...

00:15:44.460 --> 00:15:47.840
Hoshimiya Ichigo-chan does the finishing touches with a handsaw.

00:15:47.840 --> 00:15:49.930
That girl's amazing!

00:15:49.930 --> 00:15:51.530
Hoshimiya Ichigo?

00:15:53.950 --> 00:15:56.060
No other idol would do something like that.

00:15:56.060 --> 00:15:58.510
I don't know if that's good or bad for her image.

00:15:58.510 --> 00:16:00.050
I'm sure it'll be good!

00:16:00.050 --> 00:16:03.090
I don't know the details, but it seems like you did a good job.

00:16:04.110 --> 00:16:05.860
Headmistress Orihime!

00:16:05.980 --> 00:16:08.310
Here's a Christmas present for you.

00:16:08.310 --> 00:16:10.270
Cards from the Winter Collection.

00:16:13.270 --> 00:16:14.360
Rare outfits!

00:16:16.850 --> 00:16:18.870
It's a love costume!

00:16:19.070 --> 00:16:22.370
Wear those, and go perform in the Special Event!

00:16:22.510 --> 00:16:23.480
Yes!

00:18:22.290 --> 00:18:24.730
<i>May all those watching us upon this stage</i>

00:18:24.730 --> 00:18:27.430
<i>have a very special Christmas.</i>

00:20:27.550 --> 00:20:29.510
Have a wonderful Christmas!

00:20:29.510 --> 00:20:32.210
If you step outside, I'm sure good things will be waiting!

00:20:51.060 --> 00:20:52.040
Ichigo-chan!

00:20:52.040 --> 00:20:53.050
Yuna!

00:20:55.070 --> 00:20:56.770
Papa, Mama!

00:20:59.860 --> 00:21:01.070
But how?

00:21:01.070 --> 00:21:03.000
Sorry for coming late.

00:21:03.000 --> 00:21:04.510
Are you surprised?

00:21:04.510 --> 00:21:05.480
Yeah!

00:21:13.100 --> 00:21:15.250
And with the best timing, too.

00:21:15.390 --> 00:21:16.270
Yeah!

00:21:23.860 --> 00:21:25.370
Oh, welcome back!

00:21:26.900 --> 00:21:28.130
Here I am!

00:21:28.130 --> 00:21:30.010
Everyone, Merry Christmas!

00:21:31.740 --> 00:21:33.180
Ichigo, what's with the beard?

00:21:33.630 --> 00:21:34.970
Because it's Christmas!

00:21:34.970 --> 00:21:38.680
This is the only outfit they had left...

00:21:40.580 --> 00:21:42.580
Is a reindeer... okay?

00:21:42.580 --> 00:21:43.580
It suits you!

00:21:43.580 --> 00:21:45.090
That's not a compliment!

00:21:45.090 --> 00:21:47.030
Everyone, you having fun?

00:21:47.170 --> 00:21:48.220
Mizuki-san!

00:21:48.220 --> 00:21:49.660
Welcome!

00:21:49.660 --> 00:21:52.990
This is the best! It's Christmas with the top idol!

00:21:53.170 --> 00:21:55.070
Cheers!

00:21:59.830 --> 00:22:02.590
Merry Christmas. It's been a while.

00:22:03.650 --> 00:22:05.550
Right, I've got some info for you.

00:22:05.930 --> 00:22:08.550
You're the first person I'm telling this to.

00:22:08.550 --> 00:22:11.050
I want to pair them up right after the new year.

00:22:12.050 --> 00:22:14.400
Ichigo-chan and Mizuki.

00:22:15.710 --> 00:22:19.490
<i>At that time, I still had no idea that something so unbelievable</i>

00:22:19.490 --> 00:22:21.390
<i>was right around the corner.</i>

00:23:55.650 --> 00:23:57.740
This week's Aikatsu Aphorism!

00:23:58.590 --> 00:24:00.210
That party was so much fun!

00:24:00.210 --> 00:24:03.860
I spent so much time chatting that I didn't get to eat much.

00:24:03.860 --> 00:24:06.590
I thought that might happen, so I saved you some fried chicken!

00:24:06.590 --> 00:24:07.970
Aoi!

00:24:07.970 --> 00:24:09.810
Merry Christmas!

00:24:10.650 --> 00:24:13.320
When it comes to New Year's, you've gotta have yakiniku.

00:24:13.320 --> 00:24:14.810
Why yakiniku?

00:24:14.810 --> 00:24:16.790
Looks like I overate just a bit there.

00:24:16.790 --> 00:24:18.970
From your face, it was more than a bit!

00:24:18.970 --> 00:24:20.410
Next time on Aikatsu!

00:24:20.410 --> 00:24:21.770
Tragedy of calories!

00:24:21.770 --> 00:24:26.070
Always passionate, Idol Activities!
